WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.850
Summer plans. Option one: a summer
course with a fee of 1,500 dollars.

2
00:00:06.850 --> 00:00:11.250
Option two: a summer job
that pays 4,000 dollars.

3
00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:15.600
Most people say the course
costs 1,500 dollars.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:19.440
Economists say that number
is missing something big.

5
00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:22.140
Billionaires face the same kind of puzzle.

6
00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:26.300
So why can't even the richest
person on Earth have everything?

7
00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:29.480
In this mission, you'll
uncover the hidden cost behind

8
00:00:29.480 --> 00:00:31.080
every choice you make.

9
00:00:31.080 --> 00:00:34.700
Then you'll slide an economy
along its production possibilities

10
00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:37.330
curve and measure what it gives up.

11
00:00:37.330 --> 00:00:40.540
Your mission: find out why
even the richest person

12
00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:42.760
on Earth cannot have everything.
